+ข ↔ k\u0304h ; # THAI CHARACTER KHO KHAI
+ฃ ↔ k\u0323\u0304h ; # THAI CHARACTER KHO KHUAT
+ฅ ↔ kʹh ; # THAI CHARACTER KHO KHON
