+ฒ ↔ tʹh ; # THAI CHARACTER THO PHUTHAO
+ถ ↔ t\u0304h ; # THAI CHARACTER THO THUNG
+ธ ↔ t\u0323h ; # THAI CHARACTER THO THONG
