+ض\u0651 → ḍḍ ; # ARABIC LETTER DAD + SHADDA
+ط\u0651 → ṭṭ ; # ARABIC LETTER TAH + SHADDA
+ظ\u0651 → ẓẓ ; # ARABIC LETTER ZAH + SHADDA
